flowchart TD
  A[Normalized candidate] --> B[Build source listing key]
  B --> B1{Private manual entry?}
  B1 -->|Yes| B2[Add user scope to listing key]
  B1 -->|No| C{Same source listing exists?}
  B2 --> C
  C -->|Yes| D[Update lastSeen / retain revision when content changes]
  C -->|No| E[Resolve canonical company]
  E --> F[Load recent candidate jobs in the same visibility scope]
  F --> G[Score company/title/location/description/date/URL]
  G --> H{Hard conflict?}
  H -->|Yes| J[Create new canonical Job]
  H -->|No| I{Exact signal or score >= conservative threshold?}
  I -->|Yes| K[Attach listing to existing Job]
  I -->|No| J
  K --> L[Store JobListingMatch evidence]
  J --> M[Create JobListing]
  M --> N[Store self-match evidence for the new canonical Job]
  D --> O[Canonical job visible once]
  L --> O
  N --> O
  O --> P{Manual regroup requested?}
  P -->|Yes| Q[Require user-managed listing and matching visibility]
  Q --> R[Move listing and record MANUAL evidence]
